@startuml Sum_Ssfm_DID_E0BA
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype ortho

legend top left
    "Sum_Ssfm_DID_E0BA"

**Interfaces Legend**
   //ri141 //: DCM DataServices
   
endlegend

note top of EC
DID E0BA Handler is responsible to update the internal structure of information needed by DID E0BA and provide
signal status information about Signal Protection Calculation failures in the requested format whenever asked by DCM.
The handler manages up to 16 message entries with FPI (Failed Protection Indication) and FOI (Failed Continuous 
Operation Indication) counters using automatic priority-based sorting.
end note

component [SSFM::Sum_Ssfm_DID_E0BA] as EC{
	portin ri141
	[Sum_Ssfm_DID_E0BA]  as E
}

  ri141 -> E



@enduml